                <note rend="inline" type="source">500.A15A5/89: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Ambassador in France</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Straus</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1934-06-15T18:00:00-04:00">June 15, 1934—6
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>233. For Norman Davis. Your 442, June 14 [<hi rendition="#italic">15</hi>], 3
                    p.m. paragraph 2. Approved.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
